  "nameEn": "Forest Trail",
  "descriptionNightEn": "Walk the 12-step trail (for example, 2 × 6). At bends try right, then left. A sparking lamp — repair and light it, any other lamp — light it, and on free tiles pick up whatever lies there.",
  "descriptionEn": "The long trail has 12 steps, while one loop allows at most 10 repetitions. Put one loop inside another and do one big check on every step.",
  "descriptionDayEn": "Walk the 12-step trail (for example, 2 × 6). At bends try right, then left. Only repair a sparking lamp, turn off a shining one, leave lamps without bulbs alone, and on free tiles pick up whatever lies there."
}
